WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.730
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:10.820
Hey everyone!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.950
How're you all doing?

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.910
Hello!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.570
Who's that?

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:16.910
Isn't that Yume-chan?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.410
Hey, I think I saw her in a commercial!

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.080
Rola-chan, right?

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:28.090
That's right! We've invited these two newly debuted idols here for you today.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.420
Now I've got the knee shakes.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:36.180
Well, well. Whatever happened to the Nijino Yume-sama who just had her own solo live?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.350
Why, you...

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:40.470
A bit more relaxed?

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.100
Thanks, Rola.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.360
Now then, girls. Are you ready?

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.360
Yes!

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.150
Nijino Yume...

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.360
...and Sakuraba Rola!

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.400
Raring to go!

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.710
We're set to use these today.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.460
Our flower dresses! {not the coord name, fortuantely}

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:38.720
Yep! They're perfect for the flowery song we're singing today!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:42.350
Let's make this the very best performance we can.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.510
Yeah!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.850
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.980
It's our time to shine!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.770
That was a great song!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.320
Rola-chan and Yume-chan, right?

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.900
Count me in as their newest fan!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.990
Nice Aikatsu!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.910
We totally nailed it!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.040
Yeah, it looked like everyone was smiling.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.790
Well done. Keep it up for the afternoon performance.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.800
Yes, we'll do our best!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:51.300
I can't believe it's this late already.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.510
At least we'll make it in by curfew.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:59.230
The student council president Tsubasa-senpai is a real stickler about that.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.190
Oh yeah, her and her legendary Punishment Time. {or penalty}

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.240
What was that?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.450
I'm sure it was just the wind.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.570
Yeah.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.990
Let's keep going.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.710
Nijino Yume and Sakuraba Rola!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.590
Yes...

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.840
Nijino Yume, blood type O.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:34.640
A member of the volleyball club in elementary school, and your parents run a confectionery shop.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.470
Sakuraba Rola, blood type A.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:43.230
Daughter of a musical family tracing back generations, and your favorite food is sour konbu.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.360
How did you know?

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:50.240
Any student council president worth her salt knows every student's profile by heart.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.320
That's amazing...

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.280
So what is your reason for missing curfew?

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.330
There was a thing with shining eyes!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.990
It came chasing after us!

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.670
It's true!

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.250
Please believe us!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:09.000
Next time I expect you to prepare a better excuse.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:10.260
Now then...

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.260
It's Punishment Time!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.350
And we barely made it home in one piece...

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:24.270
Tsubasa-senpai's just too scary.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:25.560
Well now.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.690
Oh, Yuri-senpai.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.230
Were you two hit with Punishment Time?

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.150
Yes...

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:33.400
Congratulations!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.660
What's there to celebrate?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:40.410
Follow me to Yuri-chan's Dress Make—

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.040
Wait, not that one.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.460
Tsubasa-senpai Seminar!

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:51.710
A member of S4 and at the top of Theater Class, Tsubasa-senpai is a star of both the stage and TV.{or are we just running with "top" as "top person"}{yes, top person. next time}

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:55.720
The currently airing Rise of a Flight Attendant continues to top the rating charts.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:56.470
Wow.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.510
As expected.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:03.770
Back at Four Star Academy, she runs a tight ship as the student council president.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:10.320
But rather than being feared, she enjoys high popularity as a respected senpai.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.320
Do you know why?

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.200
No...

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:18.320
You'll find out for yourselves in just a moment.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.290
Done.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.330
It's perfect.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.750
Have you finished?

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.170
Y-Yes!

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.590
Then next up...

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.710
There's still more?!

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.970
It's Reward Time! {reward}{should with punishment}

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.220
Here, these are for you.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.520
Th-Thank you.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:51.400
You did a fantastic job of cleaning.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:59.910
But like I keep telling you, if you know you're going to be late, call me on your Aikatsu Mobiles.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.240
R-Right.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.740
We will.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.620
Good. You may go.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:11.170
I see. That must've been rough.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:15.420
Yeah, but now I understand why everyone likes Tsubasa-senpai.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:19.130
She's can be strict, but she'll reward you with kindness at the end.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:23.220
Tsubasa-senpai has a lot of fans in Beauty Class too.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.970
So she does.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:29.400
I haven't really talked to Tsubasa-senpai since the class sorting,

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.400
but I think today made me like her even more!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.280
What's that?

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.040
It's so early...

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.550
We will now be conducting a surprise uniform inspection.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.050
You're doing it first thing in the morning?

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.220
You, explain that bed head. {apparently Tsubasa doesn't recall that one idol from aikatsu ep 2ish who had it as her charm point}

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:06.890
Idols must always be prepared for the scrutiny of the public eye.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.230
M-My apologies!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.520
Your uniform's necktie is askew.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.600
R-Right!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.610
Your socks don't match!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.480
Sorry!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.400
Don't slouch. You'll ruin your posture.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.110
Okay!

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.820
Don't go outside with your beauty mask applied.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:21.860
Right!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.990
O-On second thought, she is a bit scary.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.620
Next, empty your pockets.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.370
O-Okay.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.910
I have this.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.880
Iron it clean and flat.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.000
I will.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.050
Next.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.710
Um, well...

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.510
Uh...

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.050
All of this.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.390
No more than 300 yen worth of snacks.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.010
Right!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:49.390
Unbelievable. Every single one of you...

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.640
It's Punishment Time!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.780
I can't believe I have to do this two days in a row.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:05.780
Big trouble!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.790
It's Tsubasa-senpai!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:21.970
Please let this slide.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:25.840
Hyuuri is a very important friend to me. {yes, ﾋｭｰﾘｰ}

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.220
Pets are forbidden in the dorms.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.720
The rules plainly state so.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:32.600
What's going on?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:36.230
There's a girl who was secretly keeping a turtle.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:39.230
Take it back home immediately.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.440
But I can't be without her...

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.610
She's my emotional support!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.700
Please!

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.120
Rules are rules.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:52.870
That's all.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.340
Hyuuri...

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:03.760
Tsubasa-senpai looked sterner then than I've ever seen her before. {..}

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.010
She did...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.180
What, are you sure?

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.390
It's really true.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.020
This way is definitely a shortcut.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.160
This is such lovely weather for a tea party.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.540
Oh yeah, the rumor mill's been all about you lately, Tsubasacchi!

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:37.040
You made some first-year cry her eyes out!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.290
I disagree.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.040
I simply provided guidance as I always do.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.800
It seems that girl was keeping a pet in secret.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:46.680
Yeah.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.430
Shouldn't you of all people understand how she feels, Tsubasa?

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.100
Rules are meant to be followed.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:57.350
More importantly, idols need to gain the strength to live on their own.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.350
What do you mean by "on their own"?

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.440
You're still saying things like that?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.400
Hear, hear!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.150
Rubby rub!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.490
Wh-What are you doing?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.370
My, just look at that blush.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.370
Good girl.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.790
That's enough...

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.870
Pardon me.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.710
Hey, have you heard?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.130
Yeah, there's some kind of mysterious light.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:27.010
It's gotta be a UMA, an unidentified mysterious animal!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:30.260
You know, like the Yeti or Nessy!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:32.390
How horrifying!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.350
It's turned into a huge deal.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.890
I guess we weren't the only ones who had a run-in with it.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.650
But to think that such a creature is inside our school...

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.530
This is an announcement from the student council president.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:54.700
All those who will not be doing Aikatsu off campus this afternoon are to gather at the field in comfortable clothing.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.670
Good, everyone's here.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:06.130
There are rumors circulating about a suspicious creature on campus.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:09.300
Therefore, we will patrol the campus

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.930
and dispel these rumors once and for all.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:19.390
Organize into patrol groups of five.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.480
Begin!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:32.950
I didn't expect to end up in the same team as Tsubasa-senpai.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.580
Did you say something?

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.450
No, nothing at all.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:41.080
Man, this area's so overrun with weeds it's hard to walk.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.960
Make sure not to hurt yourself.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:49.340
<i>They're only seeing illusions of a mysterious beast because of the weakness in their hearts.</i>

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:52.840
H-Hey, Tsubasa-senpai...

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:57.600
<i>Idols must be strong in order to live on their own.</i>

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.600
Senpai!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.100
What?

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.850
I think you're walking a bit too fast.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:06.860
Are you okay?

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.480
Y-Yes, I'm all right.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:15.280
Fine. Ashida Yuri will accompany Nanakura Koharu.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.120
The others will proceed at my pace.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.120
I-I'll catch up soon.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.330
You don't need to push yourself.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.250
Yuri-senpai, please look after Koharu-chan.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.590
You can count on me!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.840
We can't seem to find anything.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:38.890
That result is perfectly fine. It just serves to prove that this creature doesn't exist. {absence of evidence isn't evidence of absence}{it is actually, it just isn't proof of absence}

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.100
But I'm certain that we saw—

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.150
That sound!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.230
It's the same as back then!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.520
Hold it!

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:53.820
I'll prove that we weren't just seeing things!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.450
I'm going too!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.280
Stop, you two!

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.660
You can't run from me!

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.130
Where is it?

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.930
I-It's there!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.550
Ow...

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.140
Are you okay?

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.140
Just leave me behind and escape!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.690
No student council president would ever abandon a student in need!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.190
Tsubasa-senpai!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.320
Isn't that...

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.700
Hoo-chan? {like hoot, I presume}{I would assume otherwise but I don't know}

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:45.580
You only twisted it a little.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.620
That owl...

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.420
She used to be my friend.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.090
She was your pet?

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.340
No, it wasn't like that.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:18:01.850
When I was a child, I was terribly shy and couldn't make a single friend.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:07.100
My parents became worried for me, and hoping that it would help me learn to be assertive, {you can reverse these last two clauses if y9ou want}

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:09.860
they enrolled me into an idol school.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.860
I grew to love singing.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:18.740
With dreams of becoming a professional singer, I entered Four Star Academy.

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:20.490
But soon after...

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:24.080
You met Hime-senpai, didn't you.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:27.040
I told you about that part already.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.000
Right.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:31.000
Being an actress was fun.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:36.050
I felt as though I could spread my wings and fly beyond the horizon.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.510
Still...

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:44.510
There were times when the emotions from my childhood would come back and wash over me with unbearable sadness.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:48.520
I feared that I would once again be left alone.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:50.730
And one of those times...

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.030
I met Hoo-chan.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:58.360
Are you alone as well?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.030
Yet you're strong enough to live on your own.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:11.170
Since then, she would come by my window every night.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:12.670
Until...

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:16.130
Please, just let this slide!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:18.920
I can't be without her!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:24.050
I was forbidden from feeding or even seeing her.

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:28.560
I hadn't seen Hoo-chan since then.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.810
So that's why...

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.690
I'm a weak person.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:35.820
Huh?

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:44.570
That's why I try to provide strict guidance to the students, 
so they can have the strength to rise above their loneliness.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:49.120
No way! You're not a weak person at all.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:56.090
That aside, why did Hoo-chan suddenly reappear after all this time?

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.840
Tsubasa-senpai, look!

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.270
Could it be...

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:12.890
That must be Hoo-chan's family!

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:16.230
Is this what you wanted to show me?

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:21.740
I thought you might have been sad and alone deep in the forest.

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:25.410
But it looks like you found others to be by your side.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.040
Just like S4.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:33.370
Hoo-chan and her family have four members too!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.170
Thanks. That's exactly right.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.760
Found you!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.810
We've been looking everywhere!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.470
Where have you been?

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:52.640
Wah, look behind you!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.270
It's a mysterious creature!

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:56.810
Oh, that's just the owl...

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.900
What... is that?

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:04.530
Well, Hoo-chan makes herself thinner when she's surprised.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.830
Thank you... for the explanation.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.160
I heard about your past.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:16.790
I'll bring Hyuuri home this weekend.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.170
I see.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.550
You're strong.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.600
She's back!

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.890
Tsubasacchi!

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:37.810
Welcome back.

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:41.900
Tsubasacchi, I heard that first-year girl decided to listen to you!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.700
Just the guidance I'd expect from our student council president.

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:46.700
It wasn't me.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:51.200
I owe it to the girls who were able to convey my message.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.580
I'm glad for you.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.710
Come on, the tea party is ready.

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:58.080
Let's go!

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.920
<i>The world is vast, and countless roads await. {ep 3}</i>

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:07.470
<i>And from where I stand today...</i>

